I, for once, shall rest in peace. I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",["O"]="Bring a pair of Soulforge Legplates to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",["T"]="Anthion's Parting Words",},[26243]={["D"]="This gem looks like almost any other shard of obsidian lying around the steppes, save for a distinct red sheen. A swirling pool of smoke dances within the shard when viewed before bright light, and holding the crystal for too long reveals the tremendous heat it emanates.\
\
Someone in the Burning Steppes might be interested to see this item.",["O"]="Find someone to appraise the Blazing Gemstone.",["T"]="Blazing Gemstone",},[26244]={["D"]="Heard about some lads in Shadowforge making obsidian alloys with these suckers, turnin' 'em into magical weapons and whatnot. Always wanted ta try it meself...\
\
How about it? Promise I'll make ya somethin' good. Just need some obsidian from elementals and war reavers 'round the valley to start with, then we'll move onto th' more interesting reagents...",["O"]="Gather 24 Obsidian Fragments off of Obsidian Elementals and War Reavers around the Burning Steppes.",["T"]="Obtaining Obsidian",},[26245]={["D"]="Alright, seen them imps dancing in the lava here? Nasty buggers...\
\
Ever killed one an' seen its insides? Blazin' rock where the heart's supposed to be.\
\
Can use that in the alloy if, ya know... ya aren't scared o' a little demonic touch ta yer weapon!",["O"]="Gather 8 Smoldering Hearts from Flamekin around the Burning Steppes.",["T"]="Demonfire",},[26246]={["D"]="Ever wonder how dragons breathe fire? Most people say it's magic... but a dragon's guts are an alchemist's dream.\
\
Chemicals upon chemicals mix, then the dragon sprays 'em outta its mouth and the mixture ignites when touchin' the air. I'm goin' somewhere with this...\
\
One of the base chemicals is a good flux for our weapon, makin' the obsidian alloy bind together a bit better.\
\
The gland you're lookin' for is colored red, a deep hue and almost glowin'... oh, and it's found near the heart. Not th' ones by the lungs...\
\
Most firebreathers 'round here are dangerous, so ya might need a little help. The more mature one is, the better your odds of gettin' a gland.",["O"]="Gather 12 Flashfire Glands from dragons, dragonkin, or broodlings around the Burning Steppes.",["T"]="Dragonfire",},[26247]={["D"]="Okay... so I might've omitted a small, wee, teeny, tiny, little detail...\
\
The alloy's made, but I can't actually forge yer weapon here! Needs ta be shaped at the center o' Shadowforge City on that Black Anvil in the Blackrock Depths.\
\
I know, I know! I just thought you'd be a bit more motivated once we got all the materials is all.\
\
So... are ya? I'll send you in with some schematics -- so easy, even a baby could follow 'em! Just decide what ya want on yer way, shape it as best ya can, then bring it back here so I can complete the process. Bring some friends, too.",["O"]="Enter Blackrock Depths and forge the base of your weapon using the Black Anvil in the heart of Shadowforge City.",["T"]="Searing Armaments",},[26248]={["D"]="You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux. I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade. I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.",["O"]="Bring a set of Gauntlets of Elements to Deliana in Ironforge.",["T"]="Just Compensation",},[26249]={["D"]="You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.\
\
For now I will exchange your belt and gauntlets. If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.",["O"]="Bring a set of Gauntlets of Elements to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.",["T"]="Just Compensation",},[26250]={["D"]="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\
